{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51742","headline":"徵李怀杲（一作果）嘲道门 二 · 光业","name":"徵李怀杲（一作果）嘲道门 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山上擒来镇里收，天然模样已成囚。\n妄占气色爲徵兆，更引文章说御楼。\n长牓数张悬市内，短刀一队送江头。\n旋驱旋斩教随水，只此名爲正道流。\n（〖1〗以上二首原作一首，从赵遂之说分爲二首。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"光业","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}